### 🔴 Problem 1 — Spoiler Detection = UNSOLVED

Documents mein sirf likha hai **"avoid spoilers"** — but koi actual solution nahi.

**Real problem:**
```
Climax scene bhi visually "high emotion + high action" hogi
CLIP/DeepFace ko ye nahi pata ki ye climax hai ya mid-movie

Score engine WILL select spoilers — guaranteed
```

**Actual solution jo missing hai:**
```python
# Timeline-aware scoring
# Scene position = temporal weight

position_penalty = {
    "first_20%":  1.0,   # Safe — use freely
    "20%-60%":    0.9,   # Mostly safe
    "60%-80%":    0.6,   # Caution
    "last_20%":   0.1,   # Heavily penalized — likely climax/ending
}

final_score = raw_score * position_penalty[scene_position]
```

Ye simple rule bhi nahi diya documents mein. Bina iske trailer automatically movie ka ending dikha dega.

