### 🔴 Problem 2 — Narrative Arc = Missing Entirely

Documents mein "top K scenes select karo" bola — but trailer storytelling kaam nahi karta aise.

**Real trailer structure:**
```
[0-5s]   → HOOK  (curiosity/shock)
[5-20s]  → BUILD (world + characters introduce)
[20-35s] → TENSION (conflict escalate)
[35-50s] → PEAK (action/emotion explosion)
[50-60s] → PUNCH LINE (tagline + title card)
```

Agar sirf highest scored scenes lo — tum paoge **5 action scenes back to back** with no breathing room. Ye trailer nahi, highlight reel hai.

**What's needed — Slot-based selection:**
```python
trailer_slots = {
    "hook":     {"count": 1, "source": "first_30%", "type": ["mystery", "intrigue"]},
    "build":    {"count": 3, "source": "first_50%", "type": ["character", "world"]},
    "tension":  {"count": 3, "source": "any",       "type": ["conflict", "dialogue"]},
    "peak":     {"count": 2, "source": "50-80%",    "type": ["action", "emotion"]},
    "punchline":{"count": 1, "source": "first_30%", "type": ["tagline", "mystery"]}
}
```

